  "rankLeadEn": "Networks that usually headline global MAU charts in industry reports — editorial omission is about noise, not a moral stance.",
  "rankLeadZh": "行业报告里常见的全球头部社交网络；未列入前十的品类多为控制篇幅，不代表价值判断。",
